&lt;p&gt;We enjoyed both the beautiful river view and the pizza! We were happy to see the return of our alumni, especially &lt;a href="https://wing.comp.nus.edu.sg/author/hengchang-hu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Hengchang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://wing.comp.nus.edu.sg/author/chuang-li/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Victor&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://wing.comp.nus.edu.sg/author/ibrahim-taha-aksu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Taha&lt;/a&gt;, as well as our collaborator, Yunshan. We especially thank Hengchang (a WING PhD alumnus) for his generous donation of the pizza (and other items on the bill as well)!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Below is a gallery of the outing, photo credit to Yajing, Glenda, and Yisong!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
